From 37384c8c23a50a52ee079fb24242580700a97331 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: concept-mining <concept-mining@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:49:38 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Concept: IsTIDiff
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

For subgroups W, W1, W2 of G, the set D = W \ (W1 ∪ W2) has stabilizer exactly W under conjugation and is a TI set relative to W: every conjugate of D by an element outside W is disjoint from D. IsCyclicTIPair now extends this predicate.

Candidate bundle-dd790378, saves 5604 tokens.
